1054 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Individual Recruiting Film \055 \0441\054000\n\nIncludes\072\050 \042 Review of up to 4 full games\050 \042 3\0235 minute coach\055informed recruiting film\n \042 Skill\055specific sequencing\050 \042 Two 15\055second social clips\050 \042 Intro slide \050name\054 position\054 class year\054 GPA\054 \n    \046 measurables\051\050 \042 Clean stat overlays \050if provided\051\050 \042 Coach\055ready contact slide\050 \042 Optimized exports for YouTube\054 and sharable files\056\n\n\nTeam Recruiting Package \055 \044750 \057 Player\n\nIncludes all of the above for each participating player\056\n\nMinimum of 4 players are required for team rates\056)
     /K [ 3 ]
     /P 1055 0 R
