1056 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Availability\nOpen to all teams within MCW Starz \nOpen to players on 2 teams per tournament\056\n\nFor questions or booking\072\050mcwstarzvideos\100gmail\056com\n\nFull MCW Game Film \046 Photography\072\nhttps\072\057\057www\056patreon\056com\057c\057tylerjnorton\n\nOther MCW Media\072\050https\072\057\057www\056youtube\056com\057\100MCWStarzvideos\n\nOn youtube\054 you will also see documentary style \034Player Stories\035 videos\056 To be featured\054 please talk to either Tyler or Mandy for pricing \046 scheduling\056\n\nPersonal links\072\nhttps\072\057\057www\056tymakesstuff\056com\nIG \055 the\056traveling\056bostonian)
     /K [ 4 ]
     /P 1057 0 R
