1058 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Why This Matters\n\nCollege coaches receive hundreds of highlight videos every season\056 Most are unstructured mixtapes\056 Coaches don\031t have time for that\056 Within the first 30\02360 seconds\054 they\031re evaluating\072\n\nDecision\055making under pressure\nDefensive positioning and effort\nShot selection and efficiency\nImpact beyond scoring\n\nA recruiting film isn\031t about flashy plays\056\n\050 It\031s about showing basketball IQ\054 consistency\054 and coachability\056\n\nThese films are built using direct input from college coaches on what they actually look for during evaluation\056 \n\nThese are not \034instagram highlight reels\035\056 They are game film review style videos where coaches can easily evaluate skill\054 spacing\054 and basketball IQ\056)
     /K [ 5 ]
     /P 1059 0 R
     /Pg 1048 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

